<title>USA: FSA qualifies Swan Valley Schools, Mich., sale.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies Swan Valley Schools, Mich., sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said it has qualified for bond insurance one bond issue scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Swan Valley Public Schools, Mich., $6.9 million school building and site bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
